  "sourceTitle": "Overnight Casserole",
  "sourceText": "Overnight Casserole\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 20, 2010 - 12:22am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Raw macaroni\n1 Onion, chopped\n4 Hard cooked eggs, chopped\n1/2 pound Cheese, cubed\n2 cups Cubed ham, (or 1 can Spam)\n1 can Cream of mushroom soup\n3 cups Milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients and put into a greased 2 1/2 qt casserole. Let stand in refrigerator for 8 hours or overnight. Bake 1 hour at 350 degrees. 2 Serves 8.",
